tration purpose only, actual product may vary 9. This offer is non-transferable and shall be redeemable only by the customer/user to whom it is issued. Yum Restaurant India Pvt. Ltd./KFC reserves its right to alter / withdraw / extend the offer at any time without giving any prior notice & without assigning any reason whatsoever at its own discretion 10. All disputes related to this offer will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of New Delhi only Steps to avail: 1. Click on < https://axisbank.bankco.co.in/rewards/KFC/15/1869/1151 to generate the coupon code 2. Copy Coupon Code 3. Once the customer receives the coupon code, they will be eligible to avail the freebie at any KFC store near them (except airport stores) 4. They will need to come to a KFC, place an order for Rs 499 and above on Kiosk or KFC App for Dine-in or Takeaway 5. They will need to punch in the coupon code during checkout & the freebie will get added to their order 6. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards."}'::jsonb, 'N/A', '1. Free Large Fries on MOV 499 applicable on Dine-in & Takeaway through Kiosk & KFC App 2. The offer would be applicable for customers/users on all days, starting from 1st November 2025 and shall remain valid for such duration as Yum Restaurants India Private Limited/KFC may, at its sole discretion, determine 3. Offer valid on Dine-in & takeaway orders only through select digital channels/platforms (Kiosk/KFC App) on minimum order of Rs 499. This Offer shall not be applicable at the cash counter/point of sale at the stores, nor shall it be valid for delivery orders placed through the KFC App or any orders placed on digital platforms operated by third-party aggregators 4. This offer would be applicable for redemption by customers only on select stores* and shall be subject to the store timings 5. This offer