 is not valid at airport or transit locations 6. Yum Restaurant India Pvt. Ltd./KFC shall not be responsible for any delay, interruption, or failure to fulfil this Offer or any related obligations due to circumstances beyond its reasonable control, including but not limited to acts of God, natural disasters, war, strikes, government restrictions, system failures, or any event that makes the operation of the Offer impossible or impracticable (“Force Majeure Event”). In such cases, Yum Restaurant India Pvt. Ltd./KFC reserves the right to modify, suspend, or withdraw the Offer without prior notice 7. Offer cannot be redeemed for cash or clubbed with any other offer or promotion being run by Yum Restaurant India Pvt. Ltd./KFC 8. Product images are for illustration purpose only, actual product may vary 9. This offer is non-transferable and shall be redeemable only by the customer/user to whom it is issued. Yum Restaurant India Pvt. Ltd./KFC reserves its right to alter / withdraw / extend the offer at any time without giving any prior notice & without assigning any reason whatsoever at its own discretion 10. All disputes related to this offer will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of New Delhi only Steps to avail: 1. Click on < https://axisbank.bankco.co.in/rewards/KFC/15/1869/1151 to generate the coupon code 2. Copy Coupon Code 3. Once the customer receives the coupon code, they will be eligible to avail the freebie at any KFC store near them (except airport stores) 4. They will need to come to a KFC, place an order for Rs 499 and above on Kiosk or KFC App for Dine-in or Takeaway 5. They will need to punch in the coupon code during checkout & the freebie will get added to their order 6. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL,