ion, or discount unless specified otherwise by NUA 7. Offer is non-transferable and cannot be exchanged for cash or credit 8. In case of returns or cancellations, refunds will be processed as per NUA''s return and refund policy 9. NUA reserves the right to modify, extend, or withdraw the offer at its sole discretion without prior notice 10. Offer validity: 12 months from the date of launch/activation 11. Standard NUA terms of sale and website policies shall apply Steps to avail: 1. Click on http://brands.adneto.in/Nua18 2. Copy the coupon code shown on the screen 3. Click on Visit Website to avail the offer on the brand website 4. Add the products to your cart 5. Apply the coupon code at checkout page 6. Click "Apply" to activate the offers 7. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
