y dispute, the decision of the Max management will be final and binding, subject to Bangalore jurisdiction only Steps to avail: 1. Click on https://www.maxfashion.in/in/en 2. Add the products to your cart 3. Apply the coupon code at checkout page 4. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
