r returns/cancellations, the coupon discount will not be refunded or reissued 9. All offers are subject to Urban Ladder’s final decision Steps to avail: 1. Click on https://www.urbanladder.com/ 2. Copy the coupon code shown on the screen 3. Click on Visit Website to avail the offer on the brand website 4. Add the products to your cart 5. Apply the coupon code at checkout page 6. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
