  ('AXI-AMX-PRI-AXI-001', 'AXIS-PDF-OFFER-54', 'Travel', 'Yatra', 'Instant Discount', 'Monthly', 'Active', 'Saturday', 'Monthly', 'Cardholder', '5000', '1', '25%', 'N/A', '2026-04-01', '2026-09-30', 'https://www.yatra.com/online/terms-of-', 'Card-specific', 'AXIS-AXIS-BANK-PRIVILEGE-CREDIT-CARD', '36 Months', 'AMEXNET', 'Other', 'N/A', '{"rp_pointType":"Cash/Discount","rp_calc":"Product Offers Max discount Domestic Flights Flat 14% off INR 2,026 Minimum booking value International Flights INR 5,000 Flat 11% off INR 7,000 Domestic Hotels INR 15,000 Flat 25% off INR 7,500 To avail the discount, Card member needs to apply promo code “AMEXNET” at the time of payment. Steps to avail the offer: A. Card members will choose from the eligible category (as stated above). B. Card member will select/type “AMEXNET” as a promo code where the promo code AMEXNET is visible at the review page INR 5,000 C. Card members will fill traveler details and choose Ancillary (additional details), if required. D. At payment page, Card members will choose \"Credit card\". E. Card members will mention card details. F. Card member will fill Card details and will pay. Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank Rupay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI. • Customers wishing to opt for a business (GST) invoice will not be eligible for cashback. • Offer is not applicable on Axis Bank Corporate or Commercial cards Partner Terms & Conditions: • The offer is valid on Yatra’s Website (Link will redirect to third party website) and Mobile Application. • The offer is valid once per Card, per offer category stated above, per calendar month during the offer period. For Flights offer, discount can be availed once per category (once for Domestic flights and once for international flights) and once on Domestic Hotels per Card per calendar month on either mobile app or website (Link will redirect to third party website). • Partial Payments are not allowed. • The offer cannot be clubbed with any other offer/ scheme running at Yatra.com/app. • The offer is also applicable on Supplementary Cards also. • The offer is not applicable for Card members, redirected from any affiliate channels i.e., in case any Card member is getting redirected from any third-party website to Yatra, the offer will not be valid. • This offer is valid only on select domestic hotels, select domestic flights and select international flights where the promo code AMEXNET is visible at the checkout page. • The discount will be valid on the price, including taxes for all the respective categories, i.e., Domestic Flights, International Flights & Domestic Hotels. The discount can be availed by the Card members making purchase only through their eligible American Express Network Credit Card issued by ICICI Bank, IndusInd Bank, SBI Card and Axis Bank on Yatra. Booking needs to be done within the offer period. Travel or stay could be for later date. • There are no blackout dates under this offer. • In case of full/partial cancellation, Yatra''s offer stand void and Cardmember will not be eligible for the discount. Yatra will refund the amount after adjusting any applicable charges and penalties. Please refer to the merchant’s cancellation and amendment policy on https://www.yatra.com/online/terms-of- service.html (Link will redirect to third party website) for information on applicable charges. • Discounts will not be valid on cancelled tickets/bookings or for chargeback transactions. • This offer is not valid for travel agents. Yatra and American Express Bank reserve the right to recover the discount amount if such a case is brought or comes to Yatra notice. • All tickets and bookings will be subject to availability at the time of booking and will be governed by the standard airline terms and conditions. • This offer is not valid for split bookings where Card members make multiple bookings to avail multiple discounts on the same service/category. Yatra and American Express Bank reserve the right to recover 