mers wishing to opt for a business (GST) invoice will not be eligible for cashback. • Offer is not applicable on Axis Bank Corporate or Commercial cards Partner Terms & Conditions: • The offer is valid on Yatra’s Website (Link will redirect to third party website) and Mobile Application. • The offer is valid once per Card, per offer category stated above, per calendar month during the offer period. For Flights offer, discount can be availed once per category (once for Domestic flights and once for international flights) and once on Domestic Hotels per Card per calendar month on either mobile app or website (Link will redirect to third party website). • Partial Payments are not allowed. • The offer cannot be clubbed with any other offer/ scheme running at Yatra.com/app. • The offer is also applicable on Supplementary Cards also. • The offer is not applicable for Card members, redirected from any affiliate channels i.e., in case any Card member is getting redirected from any third-party website to Yatra, the offer will not be valid. • This offer is valid only on select domestic hotels, select domestic flights and select international flights where the promo code AMEXNET is visible at the checkout page. • The discount will be valid on the price, including taxes for all the respective categories, i.e., Domestic Flights, International Flights & Domestic Hotels. The discount can be availed by the Card members making purchase only through their eligible American Express Network Credit Card issued by ICICI Bank, IndusInd Bank, SBI Card and Axis Bank on Yatra. Booking needs to be done within the offer period. Travel or stay could be for later date. • There are no blackout dates under this offer. • In case of full/partial cancellation, Yatra''s offer stand void and Cardmember will not be eligible for the discount. Yatra will refund the amount after adjusting any applicable charges and penalties. Please refer to the merchant’s cancellation and amendment policy on https://www.yatra.com/online/terms-of- service.html (Link will redirect to third party website) for information on applicable charges. • Discounts will not be valid on cancelled tickets/bookings or for chargeback transactions. • This offer is not valid for travel agents. Yatra and American Express Bank reserve the right to recover the discount amount if such a case is brought or comes to Yatra notice. • All tickets and bookings will be subject to availability at the time of booking and will be governed by the standard airline terms and conditions. • This offer is not valid for split bookings where Card members make multiple bookings to avail multiple discounts on the same service/category. Yatra and American Express Bank reserve the right to recover the discount amount or cancel the booking if such a case is brought or comes to Yatra''s notice. • Discount provided under the offer cannot be clubbed with any other offer or extended by Yatra or American Express as part of any other arrangement. • Pictures of products shown in the communication sent to the Cardmember either through mailers or advertised on the website, are representative only and may not bear a resemblance to the actual products. • All government levies like sales tax, TDS, any local tax, octroi etc., shall be payable by the Card member as applicable at the time the respective discounts were offered. • Yatra and/or American Express reserve the right to modify, withdraw, or change any of the terms and conditions applicable to these programs/offer without prior notice. • Any disputes arising out of this offer shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of competent courts at Delhi, India only. • This is a limited period offer and both Yatra and/or American Express can change the offer terms anytime. • Cardmember can contact Yatra at support@yatra.com for any queries', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('AXI-AMX-PRI-AXI-001', 'AXIS-PDF-OFFER-55', 'Shopping', 'YesMadam', 'Instant Discount', 'One Time', 'Active', 'All Days', 'Per Transaction', 'Cardholder', 'N/A', 'N/A', '₹250 discount + ₹250 cashback', 'N/A', '2026-07-15', '2026-10-15', 'https://brands.adneto.in/yesmadam', 'Card-specific', 'AXIS-AXIS-BANK-PRIVILEGE-CREDIT-CARD', '36 Months', 'YMADN500', 'Other', 'N/A', '{"rp_pointType":"Cash/Discount","rp_calc":"1. Get a flat Rs. 250 discount on your bill along with Rs. 250 cashback under this offer 2. Use Coupon code: YMADN500 3. Offer is applicable only when the service is booked via the YesMadam mobile app 4. Valid only for 1st time customers 5. For any queries, complaints, or disputes related to this coupon, please contact Yes Madam Customer Support 6. This coupon applies to both iOS and Android versions of the YesMadam app 7. YesMadam reserves the right to modify or withdraw this offer at any time without prior notice. 8. Use of this coupon implies acceptance of these terms and conditions Steps to avail: 1. Click on https://brands.adneto.in/yesmadam 2. Copy the coupon code shown on the screen 3. Click on Visit Website to download the app 4. Select the required service type 5. Apply the coupon code at the checkout page 6. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards."}'::jsonb, 'Cash/Discount', '1. Get a flat Rs. 250 discount on your bill along with Rs. 250 cashback under this offer 2. Use Coupon code: YMADN500 3. Offer is applicable only when the service is booked via the YesMadam mobile app 4. Valid only for 1st time customers 5. For any queries, complaints, or disputes related to this coupon, please contact Yes Madam Customer Support 6. This coupon applies to both iOS and Android versions of the YesMadam app 7. YesMadam reserves the right to modify or withdraw this offer at any time without prior notice. 8. Use of this coupon implies acceptance of these terms and conditions Steps to avail: 1. Click on https://brands.adneto.in/yesmadam 2. Copy the coupon code shown on the screen 3. Click on Visit Website to download the app 4. Select the required service type 5. Apply the coupon code at the checkout page 6. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('AXI-MC-WOR-AXI-003', 'AXIS-PDF-OFFER-03', 'Shopping', 'Ajio', 'Instant Discount', 'One Time', 'Active', 'All Days', 'Per Transaction', 'Cardholder', '1299', '1', '150', 'N/A', '2026-07-15', '2026-10-15', 'https://brands.adneto.in/ajio', 'Card-specific', 'AXIS-AXIS-BANK-RESERVE-CREDIT-CARD', 'No Expiry', 'ADNAJIO', 'Other', 'N/A', '{"rp_pointType":"Cash/Discount","rp_calc":"1. Get Flat Rs. 150 off on minimum order value of Rs. 1299 2. Use Coupon code: ADNAJIO 3. The offer is applicable only on the select styles available on the URL and not applicable on other products on AJIO 4. The user must sign up/login before applying the coupon code in order to avail the offer 5. Offer cannot be combined with any other promotion offered by AJIO 6. AJIO reserves the right to cancel the orders placed by Eligible Users if the transaction is found to be of fraudulent nature 7. AJIO reserves the right to modify the terms of the Offer, or discontinue it at any time without assigning any reasons, and without any prior intimation to users 8. Coupon may be redeemed only once per user and is non-negotiable and non cashable 9. In case of any issues or questions relating to the offer, users may contact AJIO Steps to avail: 1. Click on https://brands.adneto.in/ajio 2. Copy the coupon code shown on the screen 3. Click on Visit Website to avail the offer on the brand website 4. Select the merchandise of your choice 5. Signup/ Login on AJIO 6. Apply the coupon code at checkout page 7. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards. Axis Banks Standard Terms and Conditions: . • The decision of The Merchant & Axis Bank will be final and binding on all and any correspondence in this regard will not be entertained. • The offer is not transferable, non-negotiable and cannot be En-cashed. • Incomplete / rejected / invalid / returned /disputed or unauth