y dispute, the final decision made by Muscleblaze would be final 9. The offer will not be applicable to Flash Sales or Best price products 10. The coupon code is valid once per user Steps to avail: 1. Click on https://www.muscleblaze.com/ 2. Add the product you would like to buy to the cart 3. Enter your details, apply your coupon code & proceed to checkout 4. Apply the coupon code at checkout page 5. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
