AD10K 3. This offer is valid on all eligible payment instruments during the campaign period 4. Customers must apply the promo code at checkout to avail the offer 5. Each promo code: Can be used only once per month. Is valid for one transaction only. Is non-transferable. Cannot be exchanged for cash or credit. Becomes invalid after successful redemption 6. This offer cannot be combined with: Any other bank offer. Any other coupon or promo code. Corporate or employee discounts. Any other promotional offer, unless specifically stated 7. This offer is not applicable on gift cards, gold coins, or deal/special-priced products 8. If an order is cancelled, returned, refunded, or partially cancelled: The redeemed promo code will be treated as consumed and will not be reissued 9. Any applicable refund will be processed as per the merchant''s standard refund policy 10. Orders found to be fraudulent, duplicated, or intended to misuse the offer may be cancelled without prior notice 11. The offer is valid only during the mutually agreed campaign period 12. By participating in this offer, customers agree to these Terms & Conditions Steps to avail: 1. Click on http://www.pepperfry.com 2. Add the products to your cart 3. Apply the coupon code at checkout page 4. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
