 offer is valid only as per the booking window dates mentioned in the table below (both days included) between 00:00 Hours and 23:59 Hours • The offer is valid for bookings made on Goibibo website, Mobile site, Android & iOS App only How to avail: • To avail the offer, customers must enter E-Coupon GOAXISFEST/ GOAXISINTFEST in the E-Coupon field while booking via the eligible booking channel • Customer to make the payment with the eligible Axis Bank Credit Card via a full swipe transaction • Customer to make the booking only during the valid booking window Booking Channel: Goibibo website, Mobile site, Android & iOS App only Booking Window: Month Occasion Actual Booking Window August Raksha Bandhan October 18 Aug – 20 Aug''26 Mahatma Gandhi Jayanti October 22 Sep – 24 Sep''26 Dussehra Stretch November 8 Oct – 10 Oct''26 Diwali December 28 Oct – 30 Oct''26 Christmas January 15 Dec – 17 Dec''26 New Year January 22 Dec – 24 Dec''26 Republic Day March 14 Jan – 16 Jan''27 Holi March 10 Mar – 12 Mar''27 Good Friday 16 Mar – 18 Mar''27 Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
