ckout page 4. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
